## Lazy loading

All pages use `lazy(() => import(...))` in App.tsx with `<Suspense fallback={<PageLoader />}>`.

## Sidebar navigation

Defined in `client/src/components/Sidebar.tsx` → `navItems[]`.
Add new routes in 3 places: App.tsx Route, Sidebar navItems, i18n `t.navXxx`.

## Contexts & hooks

| Hook/Context | File | Provides |
|--------------|------|----------|
| useLive() | LiveContext.tsx | WS connected, agentStats, tasks, infrastructure |
| useSettings pattern | useSettings.ts | loadClientSettings(), saveSettings() |
| useTTS() | useTTS.ts | SpeechSynthesis speak/stop |
| useVoiceNavigation() | useVoiceNavigation.ts | Keyword → wouter navigate |
| useTheme() | ThemeContext.tsx | light/pastel/dark |
| useLanguage() | LanguageContext.tsx | locale, t(), 17 languages |
| useAuth() | AuthContext.tsx | user, login, logout |
| useTenant() | TenantContext.tsx | current tenant, switch |

## LiveContext WebSocket

Connects to `/ws` on mount. Handles:
- `connected` — handshake
- `agent_stats` — { total, active, idle }
- `tasks` — task summary counts
- `infrastructure` — ollama/qdrant/n8n status
- `task_update` — single task change
- `system_alert` — toast-worthy alerts

Use `<LiveIndicator />` in Sidebar for connection dot.

## Command palette

`CommandPalette.tsx` — Cmd+K navigation to all routes.

## PWA / offline

`InstallPrompt.tsx` — add to homescreen
`OfflineBanner.tsx` — network status
Service worker in `client/public/` (if present)

## Styling

- Tailwind CSS 4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`
- Design tokens in `client/src/index.css` (Minimal Garden theme)
- shadcn/ui components — don't modify primitives unless necessary
- Responsive: `sm:` `md:` breakpoints, sidebar collapses to 72px

## Adding a new page (checklist)

1. Create `client/src/pages/MyPage.tsx` with Sidebar + main layout
2. Add lazy import + Route in `App.tsx`
3. Add nav item in `Sidebar.tsx`
4. Add i18n keys in `lib/i18n.ts` (all 17 locales or at least th/en)
5. Add API functions in `lib/api.ts` if needed
6. Add e2e smoke test in `e2e/smoke.spec.ts` if critical path

## Storybook

`.storybook/` — component stories for ui/button, card, badge
Built to `/storybook/` in production via `pnpm build:full`
